06)----------Projection: store.s_store_name, sc.ss_store_sk, sc.ss_item_sk, sc.revenue
07)------------Inner Join: store.s_store_sk = sc.ss_store_sk
08)--------------TableScan: store projection=[s_store_sk, s_store_name]
09)--------------SubqueryAlias: sc
10)----------------Projection: store_sales.ss_store_sk, store_sales.ss_item_sk, sum(store_sales.ss_sales_price) AS revenue
11)------------------Aggregate: groupBy=[[store_sales.ss_store_sk, store_sales.ss_item_sk]], aggr=[[sum(store_sales.ss_sales_price)]]
12)--------------------Projection: store_sales.ss_item_sk, store_sales.ss_store_sk, store_sales.ss_sales_price
13)----------------------Inner Join: store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk = date_dim.d_date_sk
